ira: al hombre de sangres y de engaño abominará Jehová.", "words": [[0, 34163], [11, 34683], [13, 34943], [17, 35063], [21, 35263], [28, 35623], [37, 36709], [40, 37061], [47, 37321], [50, 37641], [58, 37961], [60, 38381], [63, 38541], [70, 39321], [80, 40101]]}, {"verse": 7, "start": 41030, "end": 49851, "text": "Y yo en la multitud de tu misericordia entraré en tu casa: adoraré hacia el templo de tu santidad en tu temor.", "words": [[0, 41030], [2, 41176], [5, 41436], [8, 41776], [11, 41876], [20, 42536], [23, 42736], [26, 42896], [39, 43896], [47, 44696], [50, 44876], [53, 45056], [59, 45878], [67, 46518], [73, 46818], [76, 47118], [83, 47738], [86, 47838], [89, 47998], [98, 48758], [101, 49038], [104, 49198]]}, {"verse": 8, "start": 50201, "end": 56720, "text": "Guíame, Jehová, en tu justicia a causa de mis enemigos; endereza delante de mí tu camino.", "words": [[0, 50582], [8, 50996], [16, 51409], [19, 51669], [22, 51829], [31, 52649], [33, 52989], [39, 53289], [42, 53569], [46, 53649], [56, 54980], [65, 55300], [73, 55800], [76, 55940], [79, 56100], [82, 56240]]}, {"verse": 9, "start": 57070, "end": 66732, "text": "Porque no hay en su boca rectitud: sus entrañas son maldad; sepulcro abierto su garganta: con su lengua adularán.", "words": [[0, 57180], [7, 57290], [10, 57550], [14, 57810], [17, 58090], [20, 58330], [25, 58630], [35, 59700], [39, 59856], [48, 60799], [52, 61079], [60, 62497], [69, 62947], [77, 63747], [80, 63987], [90, 65063], [94, 65207], [97, 65387], [104, 65887]]}, {"verse": 10, "start": 67082, "end": 76355, "text": "Desbarátalos, oh Dios; caigan de sus consejos: por la multitud de sus rebeliones échalos, porque se rebelaron contra ti.", "words": [[0, 67523], [14, 67964], [17, 68404], [23, 69283], [30, 69513], [33, 69673], [37, 69813], [47, 70793], [51, 70937], [54, 71117], [63, 71837], [66, 72017], [70, 72237], [81, 73097], [90, 74157], [97, 74497], [100, 74957], [110, 75417], [117, 75837]]}, {"verse": 11, "start": 76705, "end": 87519, "text"